**Implemented CRUD for indexeddb, see _"services\useCRUD.ts"_. For all functions it is necessary to insert the context of the database as the first parameter:** 

- createTable - creates indexeddb table based on enum;
- insert - adds new record/records to a specific table from database;
- getByColumnName - returns single record from database, searches from specific field from a table;
- getAll - returns all records from specific table;
- deleteByID - delete record from a table based on its ID;
- update - update specific record from a table.

**Simulated API call to dababase, see _"services\useDBService"_:**

- initDatabase - first function that is executed every time site is accessed. Here the version of the database is checked and migrations are performed if necessary;
- insertUserFeed - insert user feed into 2 tables, simulated database relationships;
- getUserFeed - return whole information about user feed;
- deleteFeed - delete specific set of feeds from the database.

**Created migrations logic, see _"services\migrations"_:**

- V1_init_database - first migration, create database with 2 tables, extract data from localstorage and insert it to the created database.

**Created models folder, see _".\models"_:**

- SuggestedFeed - model to work more easily with the feed suggested by the site creator. It is not used at the moment;
- UserFeed - model to work with all user feed data;
- AddedSite, SiteFeed  - models that repeats the structure of the table in the database with the same name, in order to be able to more easily extract and enter the data in the database. It is used by UserFeed.

**Added database constant variables, see _".\constants.ts"_:**

- databaseName - Name of the database;
- databaseVersion - curent version of the database;
- AddedSiteParams, SiteFeedParams - enums represent the structure of the database used by **createTable**. First parameter represents the table name, the other parameters represents fields of that table. Be careful when making changes. !!

Also I did a little refactoring on import/export methods of different classes and components :D .
